{
  "id": "MRK.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Maliko 15",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 47,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu kwibanza lya ng'wa Pilato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna aho wela ī dilū, haho na haho ligasha ibanza: Baalīho bagabīji bataale na banamhala, hamò na balangi ba shilagīlo, nīyo lyalīho pyī ī libanza ī lyose; bizunīlīja kūntunga ū Yesu. Būntongeja bantwalile kūlī Pilato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Pilato ūmūja gīkī, “Ū bebe hū ūlī ntemi o Bayudaya?” Ūshosha ūng'wīla gīkī, “H'ūmo ūlīhayīla!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji bataale bandya kūmūūla mihayo mingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Pilato ūmūja hangī gīkī, “Nibūlī ūtūshoshaga nūūlū mhayo? Hū kūhaya ūtūyigwaga pyī īyo balīkūbūūla?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yesu atashokije mhayo gūngī gose gose, ū Pilato ūyūkumya dūhū!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ūlamulwa nsango gwa kūbūlagwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū ja shigukulu ū Pilato walī na shīmīle sha kūbataligūlīla ntungwa ūmò, ūyo būnomba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho nkenaagūji nebe, witanagwa Balaba, walī watungwa hamò na biye kūlwa kwenheleja nsambo; ū wei ūbūlaga ū mu nsambo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū a banhū būng'wegeela ū Pilato kūnomba abīītīle gīt'ūmo olī obamanīlīgīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbabūja gīkī, “Mutogilwe hamo namutaligūlīle ū ntemi o Bayudaya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno walī amanile gīkī, a bagabīji bataale baalī bantūūla ū Yesu mu makono gakwe kūlwa wilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo a bagabīji bataale benabo baalī babasoosela a banhū, gīkī banombe abataligūlīle Balaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū Pilato ūbabūja hangī gīkī, “Mutogilwe nang'wīte ginehe ūyo mukūng'witanaga ntemi o Bayudaya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo būhoolanīja n'ilaka lya higūlya gīkī, “Nkomage ha nsalaba!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Pilato aho wababūja gīkī, “Ī gete wītile būbi kī?” Bongeja kūhoolanīja dūhū n'ilaka lya higūlya balīhaya, “Nkomage ha nsalaba!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū Pilato ūbona gīkī hambū hambū abayeje a banhū, na ūbataligūlīla ng'hana ū Balaba. Aho wamala kūntūla mbooko ū Yesu, ūntūūla mu makono gabo, gīkī akakong'we ha nsalaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ūgīmva nyachilū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a bashilikale būntwala ū Yesu ng'wibīndo lya numba ya h'ikūlū (litanagwa plaetolio, biyitana ibita igima, būng'wihoolekela.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnzwalīkīja ng'hanjo ya nzulunge. Būbeeja na ngikili ya ming'hwa, nayo būnzwalīkīja ū kū ntwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna bandya kūngīmba nyachilū, būyūng'wīla gīkī, “Kūlaga ūhangame ntemi o Bayudaya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būyūntūla na nang'ha ū kū ntwe, kūnū bakūnswīlaga na mate, bīīta bantugīja mazwi kūnamya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bamala ū kūngīmba nyachilū gīko, būnzuuja ī ng'hanjo ī ya nzulunge būnzwalīkīja ī shizwalo shakwe, hūna būntwala hanze kūjūnkoma ha nsalaba!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu kūkong'wa ha nsalaba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munhū ūmò, muna Kilene, Simoni ise o ba Isikanda na Lufo, akasangwa alīfuma kū ngūnda, būng'hadīkīja amūūkīje ū nsalaba gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būntwala ū Yesu, būūkanshisha h'ipandī līkitanagwa Goligota, makūlū gaho, “Ipandī lya lūpanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'winha mvinya īsangije būgota bo ngazu, gīkī ang'we; alīyo atayanukūlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būnkoma ha nsalaba, ī shizwalo shakwe būshigabanha bo kūshesela mbale, babone būlī ng'wene akūbūūcha kī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balīnkoma ha nsalaba lyalī ikanza lya sa idatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wandīke bo kūbūūlwa kwakwe būtūūlwa ho, boolī būhayile gīkī, “NTEMI O BAYUDAYA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na basambo babīlī būkong'wa hamò nang'hwe, būlī ng'wene ha nsalaba gokwe, ūmò kū būlyo bokwe, ūngī kū lūmoso. [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shūbiza shashikīīla ī shandīkwa īsho shihayile gīkī, “Akabalanījiwa hamò na bagomi.”] ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo babītīlaga haho hihī bansondagūlaga kūnū bakūshingishaga mitwe yabo balīhaya gīkī, “Haho lūūlū ng'wing'wana o kūsambagūla hekalu na kūmala kwīzenga mu shikū idatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alik'ipījage shi lūūlū, wīnge ho a ha nsalaba!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bagabīji bataale bandya kwiyineenelegeja boi bike, hamò na balangi ba shilagīlo. Būyūhaya gīkī, “Walūpījaga bangī dūhū gashi nīyo, ū wei ng'wenekīlī walemeelagwa ū kwipīja! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū nang'hwe Kilisito, ntemi wa Bayudaya ī gīko, ni ikage ho a ha nsalaba ī haha, tūbone tūzunye!” Na a babo baalī bakong'wa hamò nang'hwe nabo būyūmbyeedeleja!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūcha kwa ng'wa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī līīmi aho lyashika ntwe gatī, shūbiza ho giiti; shīkundīkīja pyī ī sī, kūshisha sa kenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu saa kenda ū Yesu ūlīla n'ilaka itaale alīhaya, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabaktani?” Ū kūshomelejiwa kwaho gīkī, “Mulungu wane, Mulungu wane, nibūlī wanilekaga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamò babo abo baalī bīmīīla henaho aho bigwa būhaya, “Bing'we ong'witana Eliya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūmò wabo ūpeela kūjūsola ibbūpyo, ūlīlobya mu siki ūlītunga kwidete, wiza ūng'winha ang'we; kūnū alīhaya, “Leka tūlole ūlū akwiza ang'wiche ū Eliya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yesu ūfunya ilaka itaale, ūzumalīka! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī lisenge lya mu hekalu lyūtandūka kūfuma kwigūlya kūshisha ha sī, lyūlekana habīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale o bashilikale igana, ūyo olī wīmīīla haho hihī, aho wabona waacha gīko ūhaya; “Bing'we ū munhū ng'wenūyū ng'hana olī Ng'wana wa ng'wa Mulungu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kūle ho hado, baalīho bakīma biloleelaga. Ū mu benabo baalīmo ba Malia Magadalena, Salume, nū Malia ū nina o ng'wa Yakobo ū ndo na Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakīma benabo bajaga būnondeela ū Yesu kūngunanha aho walī Galilaya. Baalīho na bakīma bangī bingī, abo baalī banondeela ū Yesu kwiza ī Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūjīkwa kwa ng'wa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo lwalī lwa kūlonja lonja, nguno a ha ntondo yaho yalī sabato. Hūna lūūlū aho yabiza mhīndī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu, muna Alimataya ūtimbya ng'holò, ūja ū kūlī Pilato, ūūkanomba ū mīlī go ng'wa Yesu. Ū munhū ng'wenūyo olī namhala w'ibanza nkūjiwa, nīyo nang'hwe ol'abūlindīīlile ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Pilato akakumya aho wigwa gīkī ū Yesu omalaga kūcha. Ūng'witana ū ntaale o bashilikale igana ūyo onang'hanaga ū Yesu, ūmūja ūlū ng'hana omalaga kūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamana ū kūfuma ū kūlī munhū ng'wenūyo gīkī īlī chene, ūng'winha ū Yosefu ū mimba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna aho wagwicha ū mimba a ha nsalaba, ūūkagūla ng'wenda gwawiza gwa kitaani, ūgūlingīīla ū mimba, ūgūlaaja mu shigila, shalī shisīmbilwe ng'wiwe gīt'ihalo. A ha nyango gwa shigila ūpilingītīja ho iwe, lyūchiba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba Malia Magadalena nū Malia ū nina o ng'wa Yosefu, būbona aho akalaajiwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
